  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID Lowlands Health</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activity supports an organization or a group of organizations, from here on known as recipient or consortium, who share the expressed public purpose of improving health and nutrition outcomes in the pastoral geographies of Ethiopia, through increased access and utilization of quality reproductive, maternal, newborn, child, and adolescent &amp; youth health and nutrition (RMNCAH-N) services.</narrative>
  </description>
